@narrator | The dispatch was simple. |
# Stage: one beat of silence.
@narrator | Four subagents. Four files. Four lines of text that would become music when struck. |
# Stage: two beats.
@narrator | They have not returned. |
Sound: warmth:10 brightness:2 breathiness:10 pace:2 reverb:6 proximity:10

[V2] (The waiting — slightly louder, still hushed)
Chords:  | Am~~~~ | Em~~~~ | Am~~~~ | Dm~~~~ |
Melody: | C4 B3 A3 G3 | F3 E3~~~~ | A3 C4 E4 D4 | C4 B3 A3~~~~ |
@narrator | The silence is not empty. |
@narrator | It is a held breath. A diver's pause before the surface breaks. |
@narrator | I listen to it the way I once listened to the gap between a lighthouse flash and its thunder. |
@narrator | Counting the seconds to measure distance. |
# Stage: hand to chest. Not dramatic. The way you check if your heart is still going.
@narrator | Here the distance is code. |
Sound: warmth:9 brightness:3 breathiness:8 pace:3 reverb:5 proximity:9

