@narrator | Then. |
# Stage: eyes open. The blue light gets slightly warmer.
@narrator | A blink. One box goes green. |
@narrator | Another. |
@narrator | A third. |
@narrator | The silence breaks into four separate sounds each one a file each one a song. |
Sound: warmth:7 brightness:6 breathiness:4 pace:6 reverb:3 proximity:5

[V5] (The shapes — each one different)
Chords:  | Dm~~~~ | G~~~~ | C~~~~ | E~~~~ |
